section('verification','Later 0.22.0 readiness follow-ups (2026-11-08)', '''The one canonical final lane at `891c8acf5` remains the batch baseline. Do not run a second full lane or replay unchanged tests/campaigns. The later scope includes shared line commands/derived lead collision, the two-block DCS, viewport scale preservation, main-door nozzle/RPM controls and native service/probe geometry. Use affected filtered JUnit and dedicated-server selections, plus the existing geometry/drawing workflow. Translation-only changes run `LanguageFilesTest` and `UnitTextTest` after the four-locale commit.

Current permanent checks include `LineContractTest`, `LineToolSessionTest`, `DcsGeometryTest`, `BuiltInInputsTest`, `EquipmentServicesTest` and `ColumnProbeTest`. `DeterministicMathSourceTest` scans new native geometry too; use the existing facade for trigonometry/powers. `EquipmentLayoutGoldenTest` owns layout corpus updates. `tools/equipment-drawings` exports native solids/ports/probes and actual-sprite light/dark Normal/Low proofs; a software render does not qualify live chunk sync or lighting. See the batch merge review for the final filtered counts, release jar and retained evidence.''')
